{
  "info": {
    "name": "Elineuque APIs",
    "description": "Consolidated Postman collection for Elineuque Backend",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Dashboard",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Dashboard Stats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dashboard/stats",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "dashboard",
                "stats"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves overall platform summary metrics."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Monthly Trends",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dashboard/monthly-trends?range=6m&metric=all",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "dashboard",
                "monthly-trends"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "year",
                  "value": "2024",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "range",
                  "value": "6m",
                  "description": "3m | 6m | 12m | this-year"
                },
                {
                  "key": "metric",
                  "value": "all",
                  "description": "all | jobs | items"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves monthly time trends for jobs and items."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Recent Activities",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dashboard/recent-activities?limit=5",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "dashboard",
                "recent-activities"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "5"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves recent platform activities."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Top Performers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dashboard/top-performers?limit=5",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "dashboard",
                "top-performers"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "5"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves top businesses and top promoters."
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Postman collection for Dashboard module (Admin access only)"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lead",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Submit Lead (Promoter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{promoter_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"businessName\": \"Awesome Tech Business\",\n  \"ownerName\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"phone\": \"01711122233\",\n  \"email\": \"johndoe@awesometech.com\",\n  \"address\": \"123 Tech Street, Silicon Valley\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/leads",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "leads"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🎯 Purpose\nThis API is used by a **Promoter** to submit a new business lead into the system.\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\nRequires a valid JWT token of a user with the `PROMOTER` role.\n\n### 📝 Request Body\n- **businessName**: (String, Required) Name of the business being referred.\n- **ownerName**: (String, Required) Name of the business owner.\n- **phone**: (String, Required) Contact number of the business.\n- **email**: (String, Required) Valid email address of the business.\n- **address**: (String, Required) Physical address of the business.\n\n### ✅ Expected Outcome\nA new Lead document is created in the database with status `PENDING` and linked to the Promoter's account."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Leads (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/leads",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "leads"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🎯 Purpose\nThis API is used by an **Admin** to view all the business leads submitted by all promoters across the system.\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\nRequires a valid JWT token of a user with the `ADMIN` role.\n\n### ✅ Expected Outcome\nReturns an array of all Lead objects. Each Lead object will contain the details of the business as well as the populated `promoterId` (showing the promoter's name, email, etc.) who referred them."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Leads (Promoter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{promoter_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/leads/my-leads",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "leads",
                "my-leads"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🎯 Purpose\nThis API allows a **Promoter** to view a list of all the leads they have personally submitted.\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\nRequires a valid JWT token of a user with the `PROMOTER` role.\n\n### ✅ Expected Outcome\nReturns an array of Lead objects that belong to the logged-in Promoter. Useful for showing on the Promoter's dashboard."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Single Lead (Admin/Promoter)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/leads/:id",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "leads",
                ":id"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "your_lead_id_here"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🎯 Purpose\nFetches the details of a specific business lead by its ID.\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\nRequires a valid JWT token of either `ADMIN` or `PROMOTER` role. If a `PROMOTER` requests this, they can only view it if they submitted it.\n\n### ✅ Expected Outcome\nReturns the Lead object."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Lead Status (Admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"REJECTED\",\n  \"adminNote\": \"Tried calling 3 times, number is off.\",\n  \"rejectReason\": \"Unreachable phone number\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/leads/:id/status",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "leads",
                ":id",
                "status"
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "your_lead_id_here"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 🎯 Purpose\nThis API is used by an **Admin** to update the status of a lead (e.g. `IN_PROGRESS`, `APPROVED`, `REJECTED`) and optionally leave internal notes or rejection reasons.\n\n### 🔐 Authentication\nRequires a valid JWT token of a user with the `ADMIN` role.\n\n### 📝 Request Body\n- **status**: (String, Required) Must be one of `PENDING`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `APPROVED`, `REJECTED`.\n- **adminNote**: (String, Optional) Internal note by the admin.\n- **rejectReason**: (String, Optional) The reason for rejection (visible to promoter).\n\n### ✅ Expected Outcome\nThe Lead document is updated."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "API endpoints for the Business Lead module."
    }
  ]
}